  "policy_sha256": "84f656b16099dcb248866f714453e5bd3e275bdb5d4929c4fad838ee8b29ed2c",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "gv-709299-b00001",
      "text": "Twitter users in Mozambique are mobilising to share information on the violence in the province of Cabo Delgado, which has been the site of attacks by armed groups since 2017.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "body_start": 0,
      "body_end": 175,
      "source_links": [
        "https://pt.globalvoices.org/2020/01/13/ataques-armados-no-norte-de-mocambique-continuam/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-709299-b00002",
      "text": "Since the start of the attacks, more than 900 people have been killed. In February this year, a local government report revealed that over 150,000 people had been affected by the conflict. The reason for the attacks is not completely clear, but there is some evidence that they are linked to an Islamic extremist group.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "body_start": 177,
      "body_end": 496,
      "source_links": [
        "https://allafrica.com/stories/202003170364.html",
        "https://www.voaportugues.com/a/nyusi-novamente-em-cabo-delgado-para-tentar-conter-a-insurg%C3%AAncia/5281937.html"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-709299-b00003",
      "text": "Read more: New video gives clues about motives behind attacks in northern Mozambique",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "body_start": 498,
      "body_end": 582,
      "source_links": [
        "https://globalvoices.org/2020/04/28/new-video-gives-clues-about-motives-behind-attacks-in-northern-mozambique/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "h4",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-709299-b00004",
      "text": "In mid-May, the Mozambican government joined other presidents from southern Africa at a high-level conference in an apparent attempt to generate external support for the fight against insurgency.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "body_start": 584,
      "body_end": 779,
      "source_links": [
        "http://opais.sapo.mz/troika-da-sadc-concerta-posicoes-sobre-a-situacao-em-cabo-delgado"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-709299-b00005",
      "text": "Days later, the president of Mozambique announced the death of two of the leaders behind the attacks in the north.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "body_start": 781,
      "body_end": 895,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.dw.com/pt-002/ataques-em-cabo-delgado-filipe-nyusi-diz-que-fds-mataram-cabecilhas/a-53639174"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-709299-b00006",
      "text": "Many of the attacks have subsequently been revealed in videos and photos on social media, sometimes by the attackers themselves. In the absence of adequate information from the authorities, some users are trying to make sense of this content on social media:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 6,
      "body_start": 897,
      "body_end": 1155,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-709299-b00007",
      "text": "Some have noted the fact that events outside of Mozambique appear to be receiving less attention than those taking place inside:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 7,
      "body_start": 1157,
      "body_end": 1285,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-709299-b00008",
      "text": "Also being shared are warnings about misinformation:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 8,
      "body_start": 1287,
      "body_end": 1339,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-709299-b00009",
      "text": "A movement has also resurfaced with the aim of organizing solidarity campaign in support of those affected by the escalating violence in Cabo Delgado:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 9,
      "body_start": 1341,
      "body_end": 1491,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    }
  ],
